@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PROVIDER_ADMIN_TOKEN
@offeringId = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_LOCAL_OFFERING_ID

### Read offering overview; no writes, analysis or publication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Independent pages; counts and preferred authorization review cover all packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/overview?authorizationPage=2&packagePage=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid page size: 400 INVALID_PROVIDER_REQUEST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/overview?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid page: 400 INVALID_PROVIDER_REQUEST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/overview?packagePage=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown/foreign offering: 404 PROVIDER_RECORD_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing authentication: 401; ordinary tenant/support tokens cannot grant provider access
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/overview
